ourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"Nscale洽谈Anthropic 450亿美元算力协议以提振IPO","summary":"英伟达支持的数据中心开发商Nscale正与Anthropic谈判约450亿美元的云计算协议，涉及西弗吉尼亚州Monarch园区第二栋建筑，最快数日内敲定。该建筑将提供460兆瓦算力并采用英伟达Vera Rubin AI芯片，Anthropic同时获得第三栋建筑的优先谈判权。此前双方已签署最高约446亿美元的现有基础设施协议，微软曾计划承租但于今年夏天退出。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783961","publishedAt":"2026-10-19T20:16:11.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":1,"citationId":"ir1zvgutaqpm1f8nqbm45qtq3"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"摩根士丹利绘制AI资本支出流向图：英伟达拿走6900亿美元","summary":"摩根士丹利首次绘制2027年1.58万亿美元AI资本支出流向图，显示约三分之二的S&P 500受益金额流向英伟达，其余499家成分股仅分得约3390亿美元。报告指出，超大规模云服务商已披露逾1.1万亿美元尚未启动的租约承诺，这部分“合成资本支出”未计入现金流量表但经济实质等同于债务融资；其自由现金流缺口预计将在2027年达到最大，债务融资压力将显著上升。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783876","publishedAt":"2026-10-19T00:58:50.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"followUp":"2026-10-19","citationId":"bep5q8su3y7ess9mav182y4mf"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"摩根大通将存款代币 JPM Coin 扩展至以太坊，面向机构客户开放","summary":"摩根大通宣布将存款代币 JPM Coin 上线以太坊网络，面向机构客户开放。该代币锚定美元存款，支持全天候、秒级完成转账与收款，而非此前需数个工作日；JPM Coin 去年首次推出，此前运行于 Coinbase 关联区块链 Base 之上。","sourceName":"PANews","sourceUrl":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a15309-af6a-7704-b1af-8078a0485c1e","publishedAt":"2026-10-19T07:21:46.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":6,"citationId":"rti017e96qjivxclu7sd57s8j"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"瑞银交易台：上周美股走势与“AI股神爆仓”那次非常像","summary":"瑞银交易台交易员Torsten Sippel在周报中指出，上周美股走势与数月前由 Situational Awareness 基金引发的去杠杆行情高度相似，属于定向的仓位重置而非全面抛售。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783874","publishedAt":"2026-10-19T00:06:38.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"dd3y72z0t3wfzbucrkffb5src"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"惠誉警告美国主权评级下调风险，2026财年赤字达1.99万亿美元","summary":"惠誉评级警告，若财政赤字、利息支出占收入比重及政府债务占GDP比率持续恶化且缺乏可信财政调整方案，美国主权评级将面临下调压力。2026财年美国联邦财政赤字达1.99万亿美元，同比扩大12%，净利息支出创纪录突破1.05万亿美元。惠誉同时将法国、英国列为债务稳定面临威胁、主权评级面临下调风险的国家。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783960","publishedAt":"2026-10-19T20:44:32.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"hyqvefa7mtgktuag5swu1kyaj"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/c805ddc63768b4f0fa179b6390f69b3d1685a403018bf6443a0365d5673b4862.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/37d4e70beec4574e9b457f547ecba779ae6a3ec96ca2f9d4a852ac50e9715247.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/c805ddc63768b4f0fa179b6390f69b3d1685a403018bf6443a0365d5673b4862.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"潘功胜：人民银行将研究择机把公开市场主要操作品种期限切换为隔夜","summary":"中国人民银行行长潘功胜在2026金融街论坛年会开幕式表示，人民银行将研究择机把央行公开市场主要操作品种的期限切换为隔夜，公开市场隔夜回购利率将相应成为主要政策利率。他同时提出推动贷款利率定价基准向多元化转型，财务能力强的企业可协商自主选择银行间隔夜回购利率或LPR作为浮动利率贷款定价基准，并推动退出金融机构存贷款基准利率，用市场化利率指标替代计息依据。","sourceName":"界面新闻","sourceUrl":"https://www.jiemian.com/article/15207510.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-19T08:48:29.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"otherSources":1,"related":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/c805ddc63768b4f0fa179b6390f69b3d1685a403018bf6443a0365d5673b4862.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/37d4e70beec4574e9b457f547ecba779ae6a3ec96ca2f9d4a852ac50e9715247.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/c805ddc63768b4f0fa179b6390f69b3d1685a403018bf6443a0365d5673b4862.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"央行行长潘功胜在金融街论坛宣布五项政策措施","summary":null,"sourceName":"界面新闻","sourceUrl":"https://www.jiemian.com/article/15207929.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-19T09:25:55.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"u90ijcyzrbegtca8lp5wzvshk"}],"citationId":"yp6zvl14umy7v0s3cvxsg9sl5"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/7e8ce065105487100c687f545f71e93c52c1c1932a32143bdd0fb0fffc4d7d49.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/0bbfd8b9f25f24983634e6e6abd82994e0befec127adb0ea475e2dab16084c08.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/7e8ce065105487100c687f545f71e93c52c1c1932a32143bdd0fb0fffc4d7d49.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"俄副总理：俄柴油将在合同签署后15至20天内抵美","summary":"俄罗斯副总理诺瓦克表示，俄美柴油供应协议商业条款正在谈判，合同签署后燃料将在15至20天内抵达美国市场。根据特朗普上周宣布的协议，俄罗斯将向美国及全球市场供应数百万吨柴油，首批超过30万吨，随后11月供应50万吨，紧接着供应100万吨。作为协议一部分，美国财政部暂停了对俄罗斯柴油出口的制裁直至4月7日。","sourceName":"东方财富","sourceUrl":"http://finance.eastmoney.com/news/1344,202610193899262682.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-19T00:20:31.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"du0anrwflcsjdjgly55mx9yv0"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2cd8f96042d65c570d5aeba09ed82b994df30d57b7996e76abd7c263e69143ac.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"印尼股指跌至六年低点 MSCI降级担忧加剧","summary":"印尼基准股指周一暴跌逾5%，触及六年低点，因市场担忧MSCI可能将印尼从新兴市场降为独立地位。高盛警告，若被完全移出MSCI新兴市场指数，可能触发约$5.6 billion的被动资金流出。","sourceName":"CNBC Top News","sourceUrl":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/19/indonesian-stocks-msci-downgrade-fears-mount.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-19T03:00:33.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":1,"followUp":"2026-10-18","citationId":"mlwdlmzz7yffrefnnkd5uz078"},{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":null,"title":"Tether 称冻结措施致伊朗关联稳定币交易量下降 94%","summary":"Tether CEO Paolo Ardoino 称公司自 2023 年以来冻结伊朗关联地址，导致 USDT 在伊朗关联钱包的交易量下降 94%，并披露 2026 年冻结约 5.5 亿美元 USDT，其中 4 月和 7 月两批次占 4.7 亿美元。","sourceName":"Crypto Briefing","sourceUrl":"https://cryptobriefing.com/tether-iran-stablecoin-volumes-drop-94/","publishedAt":"2026-10-19T20:25:47.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"o213ntrrd5divb4lvmqzsx3jo"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/79a5eb1742a839a34e8eba3975a15b3e2c76c9a88080b44a4f7703dd2968e315.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"贝莱德申请比特币管理保护 ETF，提供 IBIT 下行保护","summary":"贝莱德向 SEC 提交申请，拟推出 iShares Bitcoin Managed Protect ETF，旨在提供 iShares Bitcoin Trust ETF（IBIT）的上行收益及一定程度的下行保护。","sourceName":"链捕手 ChainCatcher","sourceUrl":"https://www.chaincatcher.com/article/2297423","publishedAt